{"text":"kuruntokai","n":230,"lines":["அம்ம வாழி தோழி கொண்கன்","தானது துணிகுவ னல்லன் யானென்","பேதை மையாற் பெருந்தகை கெழுமி","நோதகச் செய்ததொன் றுடையேன் கொல்லோ","வயச்சுறா வழங்குநீர் அத்தம்","சின்னாள் அன்ன வரவறி யானே"],"tr":["amma vāḻi tōḻi koṇkaṉ","tāṉatu tuṇikuva ṉallaṉ yāṉeṉ","pētai maiyāṟ peruntakai keḻumi","nōtakac ceytatoṉ ṟuṭaiyēṉ kollō","vayaccuṟā vaḻaṅkunīr attam","ciṉṉāḷ aṉṉa varavaṟi yāṉē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"neytal","tinai_ta":"நெய்தல்","speaker_ta":"தோழி கூற்று","poet_ta":"அறிவுடை நம்பியார்","speaker_en":"her friend (tōḻi)","poet_tr":"Aṟivuṭai Nampiyār"},"scan":{"meter":"nēricai āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"6 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"5×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 23"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"āciriyattaḷai 15, veṇṭaḷai 7"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"அம்ம","tr":"amma","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"அம்","tr":"am"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ம","tr":"ma"}]},{"text":"வாழி","tr":"vāḻi","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வா","tr":"vā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ழி","tr":"ḻi"}]},{"text":"தோழி","tr":"tōḻi","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தோ","tr":"tō"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ழி","tr":"ḻi"}]},{"text":"கொண்கன்","tr":"koṇkaṉ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கொண்","tr":"koṇ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கன்","tr":"kaṉ"}]}],[{"text":"தானது","tr":"tāṉatu","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தா","tr":"tā"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"னது","tr":"ṉatu"}]},{"text":"துணிகுவ","tr":"tuṇikuva","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"துணி","tr":"tuṇi"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"குவ","tr":"kuva"}]},{"text":"னல்லன்","tr":"ṉallaṉ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"னல்","tr":"ṉal"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"லன்","tr":"laṉ"}]},{"text":"யானென்","tr":"yāṉeṉ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"யா","tr":"yā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னென்","tr":"ṉeṉ"}]}],[{"text":"பேதை","tr":"pētai","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"பே","tr":"pē"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தை","tr":"tai"}]},{"text":"மையாற்","tr":"maiyāṟ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"மை","tr":"mai"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யாற்","tr":"yāṟ"}]},{"text":"பெருந்தகை","tr":"peruntakai","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பெருந்","tr":"perun"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"தகை","tr":"takai"}]},{"text":"கெழுமி","tr":"keḻumi","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"கெழு","tr":"keḻu"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"மி","tr":"mi"}]}],[{"text":"நோதகச்","tr":"nōtakac","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நோ","tr":"nō"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"தகச்","tr":"takac"}]},{"text":"செய்ததொன்","tr":"ceytatoṉ","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"செய்","tr":"cey"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"ததொன்","tr":"tatoṉ"}]},{"text":"றுடையேன்","tr":"ṟuṭaiyēṉ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"றுடை","tr":"ṟuṭai"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யேன்","tr":"yēṉ"}]},{"text":"கொல்லோ","tr":"kollō","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கொல்","tr":"kol"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"லோ","tr":"lō"}]}],[{"text":"வயச்சுறா","tr":"vayaccuṟā","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"வயச்","tr":"vayac"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"சுறா","tr":"cuṟā"}]},{"text":"வழங்குநீர்","tr":"vaḻaṅkunīr","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"வழங்","tr":"vaḻaṅ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"குநீர்","tr":"kunīr"}]},{"text":"அத்தம்","tr":"attam","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"அத்","tr":"at"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தம்","tr":"tam"}]}],[{"text":"சின்னாள்","tr":"ciṉṉāḷ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"சின்","tr":"ciṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னாள்","tr":"ṉāḷ"}]},{"text":"அன்ன","tr":"aṉṉa","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"அன்","tr":"aṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ன","tr":"ṉa"}]},{"text":"வரவறி","tr":"varavaṟi","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"வர","tr":"vara"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"வறி","tr":"vaṟi"}]},{"text":"யானே","tr":"yāṉē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"யா","tr":"yā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னே","tr":"ṉē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"அம்ம","parts":[{"text":"அம்ம","lemma":"அம்ம","gloss":"listen"}],"gloss":"Listen"},{"surface":"வாழி","parts":[{"text":"வாழி","lemma":"வாழ்","gloss":"live"}],"gloss":"may you live long"},{"surface":"தோழி","parts":[{"text":"தோழி","lemma":"தோழி","gloss":"friend"}],"gloss":"friend"},{"surface":"கொண்கன்","parts":[{"text":"கொண்கன்","lemma":"கொண்கன்","gloss":"maritime chief"}],"gloss":"the chief"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"தான்","parts":[{"text":"தான்","lemma":"தான்","gloss":"he"}],"gloss":"he"},{"surface":"அது","parts":[{"text":"அது","lemma":"அது","gloss":"euphonic particle"}],"gloss":"euphonic particle"},{"surface":"துணிகுவன்","parts":[{"text":"துணி","lemma":"துணி","gloss":"resolve"},{"text":"கு","lemma":"கு","gloss":"future marker"},{"text":"அன்","lemma":"அன்","gloss":"masculine singular suffix"}],"gloss":"he would dare"},{"surface":"அல்லன்","parts":[{"text":"அல்","lemma":"அல்","gloss":"not"},{"text":"அன்","lemma":"அன்","gloss":"masculine singular suffix"}],"gloss":"he is not"},{"surface":"யான்","parts":[{"text":"யான்","lemma":"யான்","gloss":"I"}],"gloss":"I"},{"surface":"என்","parts":[{"text":"என்","lemma":"என்","gloss":"my"}],"gloss":"my"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பேதைமையால்","parts":[{"text":"பேதைமை","lemma":"பேதைமை","gloss":"foolishness"},{"text":"ஆல்","lemma":"ஆல்","gloss":"instrumental case"}],"gloss":"due to my foolishness"},{"surface":"பெருந்தகை","parts":[{"text":"பெருந்தகை","lemma":"பெருந்தகை","gloss":"the noble man"}],"gloss":"the noble man","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"கெழுமி","parts":[{"text":"கெழுமு","lemma":"கெழுமு","gloss":"associate"},{"text":"இ","lemma":"இ","gloss":"past participle"}],"gloss":"having associated with"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நோதக","parts":[{"text":"நோ","lemma":"நோ","gloss":"pain"},{"text":"தக","lemma":"தக","gloss":"to fit"}],"gloss":"painfully"},{"surface":"செய்தது","parts":[{"text":"செய்","lemma":"செய்","gloss":"do"},{"text":"த","lemma":"து","gloss":"past tense"},{"text":"து","lemma":"து","gloss":"neuter singular"}],"gloss":"that which was done"},{"surface":"ஒன்று","parts":[{"text":"ஒன்று","lemma":"ஒன்று","gloss":"one thing"}],"gloss":"one thing"},{"surface":"உடையேன்","parts":[{"text":"உடை","lemma":"உடை","gloss":"possess"},{"text":"ஏன்","lemma":"ஏன்","gloss":"first person singular"}],"gloss":"I possess"},{"surface":"கொல்லோ","parts":[{"text":"கொல்","lemma":"கொல்","gloss":"particle of doubt"},{"text":"ஓ","lemma":"ஓ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"is it so?"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வய","parts":[{"text":"வய","lemma":"வய","gloss":"strong"}],"gloss":"strong"},{"surface":"சுறா","parts":[{"text":"சுறா","lemma":"சுறா","gloss":"shark"}],"gloss":"shark"},{"surface":"வழங்கு","parts":[{"text":"வழங்கு","lemma":"வழங்கு","gloss":"roaming"}],"gloss":"roaming"},{"surface":"நீர்","parts":[{"text":"நீர்","lemma":"நீர்","gloss":"water"}],"gloss":"water"},{"surface":"அத்தம்","parts":[{"text":"அத்தம்","lemma":"அத்தம்","gloss":"difficult path"}],"gloss":"difficult path"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"சின்னாள்","parts":[{"text":"சில்","lemma":"சில்","gloss":"few"},{"text":"நாள்","lemma":"நாள்","gloss":"days"}],"gloss":"few days"},{"surface":"அன்ன","parts":[{"text":"அன்ன","lemma":"அன்ன","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"like"},{"surface":"வரவு","parts":[{"text":"வரவு","lemma":"வா","gloss":"coming"}],"gloss":"coming"},{"surface":"அறியானே","parts":[{"text":"அறி","lemma":"அறி","gloss":"know"},{"text":"ஆன்","lemma":"ஆன்","gloss":"negative masculine singular"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"he does not know indeed"}]}],"literal":"Listen, may you live long, friend! The chief / himself would not dare to do this. Did I, / due to my foolishness, having associated with that noble man, / do something painful to him? / Through the water-path where strong sharks roam, / he does not know to make his coming last only a few days.","translation":"Listen, my friend, may you live long! The chief would never choose to do this on his own. Could it be that I, in my foolishness, did something to hurt that noble man when we met? For he does not know how to limit his visits to just a few days, crossing the perilous sea-path where powerful sharks roam.","modern":"தோழியே, நீ வாழ்க! நம் தலைவன் தானாக இப்படித் துணியமாட்டான். என்னுடைய அறியாமையினால், அந்தப் பெருந்தகையோடு பழகி, அவருக்கு வருத்தம் தரும்படியான காரியம் ஏதேனும் செய்துவிட்டேனோ? வலிமையான சுறா மீன்கள் நடமாடும் கடற்பாதையில், சில நாட்கள் மட்டுமே வந்துபோகும் வழக்கத்தை அவன் அறியவில்லையே!","explanation":"This poem is set in the coastal landscape (neytal tiṇai), where the friend (tōḻi) speaks to the heroine (talaivi) while the hero is listening nearby in secret. The friend expresses deep anxiety over the hero's dangerous nightly journeys across the shark-infested sea to meet the heroine. She wonders aloud if she committed some foolish mistake during their meetings that causes the noble hero to continuously risk his life instead of seeking a permanent marriage. By highlighting the terrifying presence of strong sharks in the water-path, the friend indirectly urges the hidden hero to stop these perilous nocturnal visits and formalize their union. The key words 'vaya' (strong), 'cuṟā' (shark), and 'attam' (difficult path) emphasize the physical dangers of the coastal landscape, reflecting the emotional distress of the women.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.5],[0.5,0.7],[0.7,1.0],[1.0,1.5],[1.5,2.7],[2.7,2.91],[3.15,3.6],[3.68,4.0],[4.0,4.67],[4.67,5.0],[5.0,5.7],[5.7,5.9],[5.9,7.27],[7.27,7.65],[7.65,7.7],[7.7,8.15],[8.6,8.67],[8.82,9.54],[9.54,10.4],[10.4,11.34],[11.34,11.5],[11.5,12.35],[12.35,12.47]],"female":[[0.0,0.5],[0.5,0.7],[0.7,1.0],[1.0,1.5],[1.5,2.7],[2.7,2.91],[3.15,3.6],[3.67,3.96],[3.96,4.1],[4.1,4.1],[4.1,6.0],[6.0,6.2],[6.2,6.2],[6.2,7.66],[7.66,7.66],[7.66,7.9],[7.9,7.9],[7.9,10.05],[10.05,10.05],[10.05,12.2],[12.2,12.54],[12.54,12.9],[13.0,13.38]]}}